{"unit_id":"AL-spiritphoenix__dsh-auto-model#card-zh","repo":"AL-spiritphoenix/dsh-auto-model","commit":"d4e74211b8b8e82e5db59648bcad173ade69b1e3","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-auto-model 是面向 DSH web profile 的自动模型路由插件，会注册一个可在模型选择器中使用的 Auto 虚拟模型，并在每轮请求时通过分类调用判断任务复杂度，再把请求路由到 DeepSeek V4 Flash 或 V4 Pro。它会缓存同一轮的分类结果，并在分类失败时按配置选择回退模型；适合希望简单任务走快速模型、复杂任务使用更强模型的 DSH 用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:61-119","index.js:163-200"]}
{"unit_id":"AL-spiritphoenix__dsh-auto-model#card-en","repo":"AL-spiritphoenix/dsh-auto-model","commit":"d4e74211b8b8e82e5db59648bcad173ade69b1e3","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-auto-model adds an Auto virtual model to the DSH web selector. It classifies each turn and routes requests to DeepSeek V4 Flash or V4 Pro based on task complexity. The routing decision is reused within a turn, with a configurable model fallback when classification fails.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:61-119","index.js:163-200"]}
